<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu falls to 4.6025 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu falls to 4.6025 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu fell to 4.6025 per dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.5990 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				    Oct 10		  Oct 9</p>
<p> lei per dollar		 4.6025		  4.5990</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	    50,000		  20,000</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
